hostname r2
!
ip routing
!
! -------------------------------------------------------
! Node: r2  (ABR — Area 0 and Area 1)
!
! This router is an Area Border Router (ABR).
! Ethernet1 connects to r1 in Area 1.
! Ethernet2 connects to r3 in Area 0 (backbone).
! The loopback should be in Area 0 (backbone ABRs
! must participate in the backbone).
!
! What you need to configure here:
!   - OSPF process "CORE" with router-id 10.0.0.2
!   - ip ospf area 1 on Ethernet1 (link to r1, Area 1 side)
!   - ip ospf area 0 on Ethernet2 (link to r3, backbone side)
!   - ip ospf area 0 on Loopback0, marked passive
! Hint:
!   interface Loopback0
!    ip ospf area 0
!   !
!   interface Ethernet1
!    ip ospf area 1
!   !
!   interface Ethernet2
!    ip ospf area 0
!   !
!   router ospf 1
!    ospf router-id 10.0.0.2
!    passive-interface Loopback0
! -------------------------------------------------------
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.0.0.2/32
!
interface Ethernet1
 no switchport
 description to r1
 ip address 10.1.12.2/30
!
interface Ethernet2
 no switchport
 description to r3
 ip address 10.1.23.1/30
!
